  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="96d61dbf-3dd7-52e2-beed-df2424eee238" activityNameId="6a24db1a-d3fa-5d95-8ed9-210cb0c3298e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, at wind farm</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, at wind farm
UUID=542e8ae5-f22c-39fe-8d11-7681851e9dfc
Swiss electricity mix, from wind farm. Includes the operation of the wind farm with the necessary change of gear oil.
100MW wind farm, consisting of 2.3MW onshore turbines (conrete and steel towers) and 3.4MW onshore wind turbines.
Model is based on the electricity production in Switzerland between 2020-2024, with a capacity factor of 19.7% (source: BFE 2025).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years. Annual electricity production is 173 GWh, applying a capacity factor of 19.7%.
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_542e8ae5-f22c-39fe-8d11-7681851e9dfc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
